# Generated fixtures are written with LF by scripts/snapshot-*.ts and
# packages/server/src/cli/snapshot-*.ts, and several suites compare the generated bytes against
# the committed file. On a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true, git would otherwise rewrite
# them to CRLF and those comparisons fail with a diff that has no semantic content.
#
# Deliberately scoped to generated files rather than the whole repo: a repo-wide `eol=lf` would
# renormalize every source file at once, which is a much larger change than the problem needs.
packages/engine/tests/fixtures/** text eol=lf
packages/server/fixtures/** text eol=lf
